---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
const description = 'What Practice Packet collects. This build has no accounts and no ads.'
---
<Base title="Privacy | Practice Packet" description={description} path="/privacy/">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>Practice Packet does not ask you to create an account. Worksheets, answer keys, and the new-numbers button run without a login.</p>
  <p>This build does not include advertising and does not set advertising cookies. If that changes, this page will say so before ads are turned on.</p>
  <p>If you email <a href="mailto:contact@practicepacket.com">contact@practicepacket.com</a>, we receive whatever you put in that message and use it only to reply. Do not send student names or other student records.</p>
  <p>The site is published as static pages. Server logs, if the host keeps them, are the host’s ordinary request logs.</p>
</Base>
